=Optimize this social media post for maximum engagement on each target platform.

**Original Content:**
{{ $json.content }}

**Hashtags:** {{ $json.hashtags }}
**Post Type:** {{ $json.postType }}
**Link:** {{ $json.linkUrl }}
**Campaign:** {{ $json.campaign }}
**Target Platforms:** {{ $json.platforms.join(', ') }}

**Optimization Mode:** {{ $json.aiOptimization }}

**Platform Guidelines:**
- LinkedIn: Professional tone, 1300 chars max, 3-5 hashtags, thought leadership focus
- Twitter/X: Concise, 280 chars max, 2-3 hashtags, conversational, use hooks
- Facebook: Casual/friendly, can be longer, fewer hashtags, encourage engagement
- Instagram: Visual focus, 2200 chars max, up to 30 hashtags, emojis welcome

**Generate optimized versions for each target platform:**

```json
{
  "linkedin": {
    "content": "optimized content for LinkedIn",
    "hashtags": "#tag1 #tag2 #tag3"
  },
  "twitter": {
    "content": "optimized content for Twitter/X",
    "hashtags": "#tag1 #tag2"
  },
  "facebook": {
    "content": "optimized content for Facebook",
    "hashtags": "#tag1"
  },
  "instagram": {
    "content": "optimized content for Instagram",
    "hashtags": "#tag1 #tag2 ... #tag10"
  },
  "bestPostingTimes": {
    "linkedin": "Tuesday-Thursday 8-10 AM",
    "twitter": "Weekdays 12-3 PM",
    "facebook": "Wednesday 11 AM - 1 PM",
    "instagram": "Monday-Friday 11 AM - 1 PM"
  }
}
```

